{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two PlayStation\u00ae1 classics return: Fighting Force and Fighting Force 2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the games like never before with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tSave States</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tRewind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tUprendering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tCRT Filters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tBonus Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tGame Selector</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tSupport for Remote Play Together in Fighting Force 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighting Force</strong>: Originally released in 1997, this beat 'em up classic let players become Hawk Manson, Mace Daniels, Alana McKendricks, or Ben &quot;Smasher&quot; Johnson as they fight to take down the evil Dr. Dex Zeng.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from two male or two female characters, each with different skills and strengths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or in co-op mode to defeat your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of moves per character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven action packed levels in 22 different stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up weapons like rocket launchers, shotguns, pipes, guns, grenades and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighting Force 2</strong>: This follow-up released in 1999 - in this game, players take the role of Hawk Manson, who is covertly investigating human cloning experiments by the Knackmiche Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate through complex R&amp;D facilities featuring amazing visuals and advanced special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce hand-to-hand combat including deadly combination moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an arsenal of over 20 lethal weapons to assist in removal of key personnel and complete destruction of environments.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"That was way too easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/be4d7ce0713fbf69bde307c2c305d2dcd52268f2.jpg"},{"name":"Drop the gun!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/cbfca4bfb0757f83bd7414189adb0a71b7343cb0.jpg"},{"name":"Downtown Beatdown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/342ad7cbc4b753f4cc3a54154042c0a51a847c7c.jpg"},{"name":"Totaled by hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/53e9ee46540e8b3acc0ba20ed336ad070d027601.jpg"},{"name":"100,000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/b2b29ec2c120dbb4326dcb86f304b01caeb17501.jpg"},{"name":"FireFighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/31bbfb059ec6048c4216e01d34805a0c6d0776fb.jpg"},{"name":"Rocket Powered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/77a39f7b02607c6f97c3f04c2e340f2a9936c6c8.jpg"},{"name":"Snake Eater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/9e4a3c26d620bc04bb7d74ba6fd95ccec8709474.jpg"},{"name":"Four for the Price of One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/112ef170887ea3145685c7ecfbf432b5c5c8e256.jpg"},{"name":"Forgot My wallet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504580/da4e15e551c314e48fa6aeec7fd308bd8cd15df7.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504580?t=1770823194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/